      "text": "Duelists young and old, professional and amateur alike, it's the moment you've been waiting for!"
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Welcome to New Domino City, home of Turbo Dueling."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Turbo Duels are a new form of dueling that takes place on motorcycles called \"Duel Runners.\""
