    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "5ds_satellite",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "However, our story does not begin in New Domino City. We join our hero Yusei Fudo in the poorer outskirts known as \"Satellite.\""
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "notattoo_anguish",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Yusei was wronged by the undefeated Turbo Dueling champion Jack Atlas."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "The two were once friends, but Jack stole Yusei's two most prized possessions: the Stardust Dragon card and his custom Duel Runner."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Jack left Satellite and became the Turbo Dueling champion for New Domino City."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Yusei wanted to confront Jack, but unfortunately, Sector Security kept getting in his way."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "notattoo_neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
