    {
      "char": "rallydawson",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "notattoo_neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Unfortunately, Sector Security had tracked Rally and quickly closed in on Yusei and his friends."
    },
    {
      "char": "tetsutrudge",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "So it was up to Yusei to confront Sector Security and get his friends out of trouble."
